                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I like the idea of hands. The game definately has pontential but I agree with above post,  it does need some work and the speed feels a little janky in places. The fact that the coaster track in places seems to be suspended in air without any ground pillars adds to the motion sickness a bit. All in all I do believe it is worth the $5 price tag as long as the developers continue support. I do love me a good old VR coaster ride. Keep it up :)",
